OL,3,GNEWSATrain line reopens following Lewes
OL,4,Aderailment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA railway line that closed after a
OL,7,Ftrain derailed in East Sussex leaving
OL,8,F30 people injured has reopened
OL,9,Ffollowing extensive repairs.
OL,11,FThe route between Haywards Heath and
OL,12,FLewes was shut after the derailment on
OL,13,F13 August, prompting a major recovery
OL,14,Foperation and reconstruction work.
OL,16,FA defect was found on railway tracks
OL,17,Fnear Lewes following the derailment, an
OL,18,Finitial report by the Rail Accident
OL,19,FInvestigation Branch (RAIB) found.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
