OL,3,GNEWSATrain line reopens following Lewes
OL,4,Aderailment
OL,5,
OL,6,FNetwork Rail said engineers had
OL,7,Fcompleted the recovery of the train and
OL,8,Frebuilt the damaged section of railway
OL,9,Fin time for the start of the new school
OL,10,Fterm.
